# The agent image builds from the REPO ROOT (it needs agent/ + ansible/). Keep
# everything else OUT of the build context — most importantly infra/.ssh, which
# holds the fleet SSH private key (gitignored, but present on disk). Nothing that
# isn't explicitly un-ignored below ever reaches the Docker daemon.
*
!agent
!ansible

# Re-ignore dev/local cruft inside the kept trees.
agent/tests
ansible/.collections
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/*.pyc
